# Personal data must never be committed. The app keeps it outside this folder
# (~/Library/Application Support/Application Workspace), but these patterns catch
# copies dropped in here by accident: workspaces, backups, trackers and CVs.
workspace/
workspace*.json
*backup*/
Application Workspace backup*/
files/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
*.pdf
*.doc
*.docx
*.pages
.env

